# Review / forensic / scaffold artifacts -- kept in sync with
# web-ext-config.cjs ignoreFiles so a stray `git add .` cannot leak them.
# Forensic scripts in scripts/ may reference raw profile paths and should
# never end up in public history. Wildcards cover dated archives
# (.deep-dive-2026-05-09/ etc.), which hold the same class of material.
.deep-dive*/
.team-review*/
.full-review-pipeline/
scripts/
docs/
.claude/
amo-metadata.json
claude_.bat
.env.example
